                                "sense_id": "763292c6-22c5-3870-b51b-8a44e68fc6de",
                                "text": "All in all, she said, she had spent twenty-one years in gaol; which was a longer sentence than many convicts serve. And yet, there were women walking down there, too, who would outsuffer her. She had seen them come; she dared to say she would not be there to see them leave . . ."
